g2later("G2G-C04-018",4,9,"Theft","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Castle","General","Stage 2 — Begin the Dragon Hunt and work from the castle","Recover Keroloth’s stolen purse.","Speak to Keroloth. Question nearby soldiers, find the thief/stolen purse and return the money or resolve the confrontation.","Small castle investigation."),
g2later("G2G-C04-008",4,10,"Jan and the Smithy","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Castle","Dragon Hunter","Stage 2 — Begin the Dragon Hunt and work from the castle","Get Jan permission to use the castle smithy.","Speak to Jan, then ask the responsible paladin/quartermaster for permission. Resolve the request and report back to Jan.","Unlocks Dragon Hunter smithing services in the castle."),
