g2later("G2G-C04-005",4,15,"Hosh-Pak","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — Orc territory and the hunters","Kill the orc shaman Hosh-Pak.","Accept Oric’s order at the castle. Find Hosh-Pak on the hill overlooking the old mining camp/Fajeth area, defeat him and his guards, take proof and report to Oric.","Doing this changes your later encounter with Ur-Shak."),
g2later("G2G-C04-020",4,16,"Ur-Shak","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — Orc territory and the hunters","Confront Ur-Shak about Hosh-Pak and the orc war.","After killing Hosh-Pak, find Ur-Shak on the nearby hill. Talk through Hosh-Pak’s death and Ur-Shak’s allegiance, then leave the encounter according to the dialogue outcome.","The friendship from Gothic I effectively ends here."),
g2later("G2G-C04-007",4,17,"I Need to Get Out","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — Orc territory and the hunters","Help Talbin escape the Valley.","Find Talbin in his rocky hiding place and learn that his companion is gone. Clear a safe route toward the pass, escort or guide Talbin to safety, and speak to him again at the destination.","Clear orcs and beasts before starting the escort."),
g2later("G2G-C04-019",4,18,"Two Ice Colossi for Sylvio","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Ice Region","Dragon Hunter / General","Stage 4 — Finish the dragons and return to Khorinis","Kill the two ice golems blocking Sylvio’s path.","Speak to Sylvio at the ice-region entrance. Destroy the two ice golems, return to him and continue the confrontation/dialogue that follows.","Sylvio is not trustworthy; save before reporting back."),
