g2later("G2G-C04-016",4,20,"The Master of Dragons","Main Quest","Valley of Mines / Khorinis","Main quest","Stage 4 — Finish the dragons and return to Khorinis","Learn who commands the dragons and what comes next.","After killing the fourth dragon, listen to its revelation about its master. Return through the Valley, report the completed hunt to Garond/Lord Hagen/Pyrokar as required, and follow the new lead that points toward Irdorath.","Bridges Chapter 4 into the secret library and departure preparations."),
g2later("G2G-C04-011",4,21,"Neoras' Dragon Egg Brew","Side Quest","Monastery of Fire","Mage / General","Stage 4 — Finish the dragons and return to Khorinis","Bring Neoras a dragon egg for his experimental potion.","Speak to Neoras in Chapter 4 or 5. Obtain a dragon egg from a nest/Dragon Hunter source and give it to him, then return after he has brewed the potion.","Do not turn in your last egg if another faction quest still needs it."),
g2later("G2G-C04-012",4,22,"Pedro the Traitor","Side Quest","Monastery / Halls of Irdorath","Dragon Hunter","Stage 4 — Finish the dragons and return to Khorinis","Find and punish Pedro for stealing the Eye of Innos.","Receive the task from Gorax as a Dragon Hunter. The quest cannot be resolved until Chapter 6, where Pedro is imprisoned in Irdorath. Decide whether to kill or spare him according to your role-play, then report if possible.","Long-delayed faction quest.")
